  "description": "COWTOA crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C152 H168 N12 O16 Tb4,4(C2 H3 N1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb1B (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2B (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.605-3.876 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 97.52-111.78°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C160H180N16O16Tb4.",
